    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5840" root="جشب" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَشِيبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَشِبُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also Anything <i>rough,
gross or coarse, disagreeable to the taste, and
choking.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  A <i>thick, rough,</i> or <i>coarse,</i> garment, or piece of cloth. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  A <i>rough,</i> or
<i>coarse, and old, worn-out,</i> skin for water or milk.
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <i>Rude, uncivil, unkind, rough,</i> speech
or language. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  And (applied to a man,
TA) <i>A foul,</i> or <i>bad, eater.</i> (K, TA.)

